WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:02.800
Miss Chen

00:02.960 --> 00:04.520
I won't hide some news from you

00:04.600 --> 00:06.000
I came today

00:06.440 --> 00:07.680
To propose to Father

00:07.760 --> 00:09.427
To lift elder brother's confinement

00:09.520 --> 00:11.520
You didn't need to stage this

00:11.720 --> 00:13.387
We're all born of parents

00:13.920 --> 00:15.587
Give him a way out

00:21.640 --> 00:23.040
If that's the case

00:25.040 --> 00:27.040
We'll follow Prince of Jin's wishes

00:29.320 --> 00:30.520
I'm leaving
